{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/extras/gui_promos_headers_01.png?t=1743354273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lil Lootin Lizards is a unique blend of Tetris-style management and dungeon exploration. In which you are a treasure-obsessed reptile with the instincts of a loot goblin. Dwell deep into the dungeon to find all kinds of objects and magical artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entering a room in the dungeon may be met with a puzzle grid, where you must arrange and rotate various oddly-shaped chunk of blocks on to the grid cells to solve the puzzle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/extras/gui_promos_headers_02.png?t=1743354273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasure and objects you find will be transformed into blocks when you pick them up. They come in many various shapes and forms. Additionally, items also have unique tags or functionality that will help against obstacles and hostile enemies on the puzzle grid.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/extras/gui_promos_headers_03.png?t=1743354273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your journey and quest for wealth and treasure, a special Mimic chest will be present. It will judge your ability to gather vast amount of wealth and treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thus, you must periodically offer some of the hard earned loot to be sacrificed and fed. Beware, the Mimic will find a way to sate the everlasting hunger if the quota is not met...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/extras/gui_promos_headers_04.png?t=1743354273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab a friend and work together as a team to solve the dungeon puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/extras/gui_promos_headers_05.png?t=1743354273\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tetris inspired puzzles with lootable items as blocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-op multiplayer experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 60 unique items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable upgrades and perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two game modes, normal and hard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls for both keyboard and controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated puzzle layouts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405010?t=1743354273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405010?t=1743354273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/60690ed0e0f2448561020b8bdb1b2681f22c246d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743354273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/60690ed0e0f2448561020b8bdb1b2681f22c246d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743354273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/extras/gui_promos_headers_01.png?t=1743354273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lil Lootin Lizards is a unique blend of Tetris-style management and dungeon exploration. In which you are a treasure-obsessed reptile with the instincts of a loot goblin. Dwell deep into the dungeon to find all kinds of objects and magical artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entering a room in the dungeon may be met with a puzzle grid, where you must arrange and rotate various oddly-shaped chunk of blocks on to the grid cells to solve the puzzle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/extras/gui_promos_headers_02.png?t=1743354273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasure and objects you find will be transformed into blocks when you pick them up. They come in many various shapes and forms. Additionally, items also have unique tags or functionality that will help against obstacles and hostile enemies on the puzzle grid.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/extras/gui_promos_headers_03.png?t=1743354273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your journey and quest for wealth and treasure, a special Mimic chest will be present. It will judge your ability to gather vast amount of wealth and treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thus, you must periodically offer some of the hard earned loot to be sacrificed and fed. Beware, the Mimic will find a way to sate the everlasting hunger if the quota is not met...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/extras/gui_promos_headers_04.png?t=1743354273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab a friend and work together as a team to solve the dungeon puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/extras/gui_promos_headers_05.png?t=1743354273\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tetris inspired puzzles with lootable items as blocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-op multiplayer experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 60 unique items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable upgrades and perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two game modes, normal and hard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls for both keyboard and controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated puzzle layouts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Zenflux Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/header.jpg?t=1743354273","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Lil Lootin Lizards","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Anything dual core or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Shadermodel 5.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Zenflux Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/3c552f0df02271587ca8633ad379e1a077b0fc04/ss_3c552f0df02271587ca8633ad379e1a077b0fc04.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743354273","